 Member 1 (**Neurologist (Lead)**): Specializes in diagnosing and treating neurological conditions, particularly in pediatric patients. This member will assess the patient's cognitive delay, seizure disorder, and neurological symptoms, focusing on the right lower extremity weakness and how it may relate to any underlying genetic condition.
